    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="27845984-db49-5e0e-abb1-8196ae94c7d4" activityNameId="0aa9c8a8-42ea-57ae-a65c-8a69d08f3a59" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at borehole heat pump, brine-water, 15kW, cert. electr., in new building</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at borehole heat pump, brine-water, 15kW, cert. electr., in new building
Heat from a brine-water heat pump, 15kW with heat source form borehole, 150m deep and cerified electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heat pump is 20 years, the borehole 50years. SPF=5.3. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year.;
UUID: 842e8376-983c-360c-9150-6049585ef03a
Included are the share of the production of the brine-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the borehole with the geothermal proble with a lifetime of at least 50years is part of this process. 
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_842e8376-983c-360c-9150-6049585ef03a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
